OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies and one-year-old critical
OL,4,Afollowing crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died and a one-year-old girl
OL,7,Fis in a critical condition following a
OL,8,Fcrash.
OL,10,FHampshire Police said the crash between
OL,11,Fa Citroen Grand C4 Picasso, which had
OL,12,Fbroken down, and a Mercedes Sprinter
OL,13,Fvan happened on the southbound
OL,14,Fcarriageway of the A34 close to Sutton
OL,15,FScotney Services shortly before 15:15
OL,16,FBST on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
