OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies and one-year-old critical
OL,4,Afollowing crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the Citroen driver, a
OL,7,Fman in his 40s, was pronounced dead at
OL,8,Fthe scene and a woman and two children
OL,9,Fwho were travelling in the same car
OL,10,Fwere injured. One of the children
OL,11,Fremains in hospital with
OL,12,Flife-threatening injuries.
OL,14,FThe van driver was arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of causing death by careless
OL,16,Fdriving and causing serious injury by
OL,17,Fcareless driving.
